ey, however, this creature has no legs. You must use your hands to traverse your environments, and reign dominance amongst others through the fun of multiple different game modes. These game modes will help you advance in this beautiful, low-poly world.", "short_description": "This gamepage will be used for experimental and archival versions of The Monke Games, find the new one with the name \"The Monke Games\"!\n\nWelcome to The Monke Games.\n\n In this colorful wacky VR game, you are able to take the perspective of a \"monke\". You must use your hands to traverse your environments, and reign dominance amongst others through the fun of multiple different game modes. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.themonkegames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.themonkegames.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "ThunderPixelGames", "support_website_url": "https://www.themonkegames.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.themonkegames.com/home", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "CASUAL", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "8432217096788842"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568677_1493922178174100_6732740852676606509_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ctG0s_IO2B4Q7kNvwGvXUIp&_nc_oc=AdkI4be7wxEPpbIF4MlJfIXCYI109Rh